{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/08/14/6249431/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日暑いねー！\nいつになったら収まるのかな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、集合場所でまあやに\n「え？シャワー浴びてきたの？」\nって言われたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ううん。ただ暑いだけなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜこの私が乃木のので汗かき選抜に入らなかったのか。乃木坂七不思議のひとつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/08/14/6249431/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週の名古屋ライブ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱気が...！すごかったです...！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの熱を感じました...！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱いライブでした...！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった...！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれたみなさん、ありがとうございました...！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして名古屋2日目、夜の部で、なんと、\n斎藤家の歌 ３番を披露させていただきましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまたぱぱが作詞してくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのアメフト現役でやってる、サーフィンが趣味のぱぱが。ごついぱぱが。家族の歌の、歌詞を書きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人は見かけによりませんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹も手伝ってくれたよ！！ボツになったけど...m(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、み、みんな\n手をつなごうよ\n優しい気持ち 平和な世界\nみんな、み、みんな\n手をつなごうよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな覚えて、今度こそみんなで歌いたいな〜(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱い要望があれば、是非とも4番、5番と続けていけたら...と思っていますので是非！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/08/14/6249431/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近仲良しのいおりと♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるさんはー、特別にー、あほって呼んでいいですよ♡って言われた！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わー♡あほだー♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなところも可愛いの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメで告知した、ラーメンWalker2！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送は8/31に決まりました\\♡/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ千秋楽の日！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな録画してね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ちなみにこの４日間毎日ラーメン食べてます。マネージャーさんに怒られませんように...。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2015/08/14/6249431/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントみたら、神宮はやっぱり多いけど\n地方にもたくさんの方が来てくれるみたいで\n嬉しい限りです...♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとつひとつのライブを、大切に！\n全力で！頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながらライブに来れない方も、\nまたどこかで会えますように...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13thの握手会の日程も公開されたね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/28の京都が、誕生日に1番近いのかな？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方にお会いできるのを、楽しみにしてます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からは広島！！\nひめたん、まあやの地元！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なライブにするぞ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}